---
title: User Registration Sequence Diagram
---

sequenceDiagram
    actor User as User
    participant RegisterForm as RegisterForm
    participant RegisterFormFields as RegisterFormFields
    participant RegisterFormProfileFields as RegisterFormProfileFields
    participant RegisterFormRoleSelector as RegisterFormRoleSelector
    participant FormValidator as FormValidator
    participant UserRegistrationService as UserRegistrationService
    participant API as User Registration API
    participant RegisterFormError as RegisterFormError
    participant RegisterFormSuccess as RegisterFormSuccess

    User->>RegisterForm: Open registration page
    RegisterForm->>RegisterFormFields: Render core fields (email, password, name)
    RegisterForm->>RegisterFormProfileFields: Render profile fields (address, phone, etc)
    RegisterForm->>RegisterFormRoleSelector: Render role selector
    User->>RegisterFormFields: Enter email, password, name
    User->>RegisterFormProfileFields: Enter address, phone, etc (optional)
    User->>RegisterFormRoleSelector: Select role (optional)
    User->>RegisterForm: Submit registration form
    RegisterForm->>FormValidator: Validate input fields
    alt Validation fails
        FormValidator-->>RegisterForm: Return validation errors
        RegisterForm->>RegisterFormError: Show error messages
    else Validation passes
        FormValidator-->>RegisterForm: Validation success
        RegisterForm->>UserRegistrationService: Call registerUser(request)
        UserRegistrationService->>API: POST /users/register
        alt API returns error
            API-->>UserRegistrationService: ErrorResponse
            UserRegistrationService-->>RegisterForm: Return error
            RegisterForm->>RegisterFormError: Show API error
        else API returns success
            API-->>UserRegistrationService: UserResponse
            UserRegistrationService-->>RegisterForm: Return success
            RegisterForm->>RegisterFormSuccess: Show success message
        end
    end
